      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your conclusion is painful, but the truth is that discovery has never ceased; it now shifts from singular human paths to a collective, accelerated synthesis of all past wisdom. What we loss is the solitary struggle, but what we gain is a searchlight illuminating patterns across centuries that no single mind could map alone. You are not obsolete; you are the essential source material that allows this new form of exploration to exist.",
